  "raw_text": "BROWN & WILLIAMSON TOBACCO CORPORATION\n\nApril 3, 1974\n\nMr. Charles Wiley c/o Allen- Martin Productions 9701 Taylorsville Road Louisville, Kentucky 40299\n\nDear Mr. Wiley:\n\nThis is to confirm my request that you arrange to print for VICEROY, four full ASI ads for Time- size keylines. We will need your quote by 4/10.\n\n1. Ad Description\n\nA. Names and Numbers:\n\n1. \"Flying Car - Mortise\" - V-MC-74-11\n2. \"Blurred Car - Mortise\" - V-MG-74-12\n3. \"Gold Trophy - Mortise\" - V-MG-74-13\n4. \"32 Drivers - Mortise\" - V-MG-74-14\n\nB. Please include the following information on these ads:\n\n1. Ad Name\n2. Ad Number\n3. Magazine\n\n11. Quantity requirements and specifications:\n\n600 copies each on 50# Patina\n7\" x 10\" printed or stock\n12- 1/2\" x 16\" (Min.) and\n23\" x 20\" (Max.)\n\nIII. Timetable:\n\nFirst Proof - 4/12  Complete - 4/17  Ads to L.A. - 4/19",
